node_modules
packages/*/node_modules
.git
pnpm-lock.yaml
*.tsbuildinfo

# pnpm leaves root-owned 0700 `.tmp-<pkg>-*` directories inside a package it
# installs from a `file:` path. CI runs `pnpm install` in the very workspace that
# becomes this build context, so without this line those directories are COPYed
# into the image -- and the runtime user cannot read them, which makes the
# deployment's `cp -r /opt/dsh-home/. $DSH_HOME/` fail and the container
# crash-loop. Observed on ghcr.io/visecy/dsh-web-platform:v0.1.74.
**/.tmp-*
